              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Nebukadinezzari yaaseeta kumpi n'olwigi olw'ekikoomi ekiri kugeigera omuliro, yaayeta ati: “Shaduraka, Meshaki, ni Abedinego, imwe abagheereza ba Katonda Ali Ghaigulu Yeene, mufulume mwidhe ghano.” Era Shaduraka, ni Meshaki, ni Abedinego, baafuluma mu muliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'amasaza ni bakatuukiro baibwe, n'ab'amagombolola, n'abakungu ba kyabazinga abandi boonaboona, beesololeza aghaali abasaadha abo bonsatule. Baabona ng'omuliro ghazira kye gwakola ku mibiri gya basaadha abo bonsatule. Enviiri dhaibwe ku mitwe nga tidhaayokebwaku naire, waire ebivaalo byaibwe okuyaaku. Era ni beene nga tibawunha mwosi naire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
