              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Nebukadinezzari yaakoba ati: “Katonda wa Shaduraka, ni Meshaki, ni Abedinego asaakibwe. Oyo n'atumye malaika we yaawonia abagheereza be bano abaamwesize, ni badheemera ekiragiro kyange nze kyabazinga. Bataire obulamu bwaibwe mu kabi, mu kifo ky'okugheereza n'okusinza katonda yeenayeena okutoolaku Katonda owaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        }
