              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale ni mpegaano ndi kugha ekiragiro nti: abantu boonaboona, abava mu maghanga goonagoona, era aboogera enimi dhoonadhoona, bwebanaayogera ekibi kyonakyona ku Katonda wa Shaduraka, ni Meshaki, ni Abedinego, ndidha kulagira babatemeteme, emigulu gigwe ghaagyo n'emikono gigwe ghaagyo. Era endhu dhaimwe baidha kudhizikiriza dhifuuke bifulukwa byereere; kuba ezirayo katonda asobola kuwonia bantu be mu nsambo ng'oti n'eyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
